      <p class="content-split__text">The Community Foundation maintains a collection of event equipment available to nonprofits at affordable rates. From tents and tables to coolers and chairs — we've got you covered for your next event.</p>
      <ul class="content-split__list">
        <li>Tents — 20x20 frame, 20x20 pole, 20x40 pole</li>
        <li>Tables — 4ft, 6ft, 8ft rectangle, cocktail</li>
        <li>Chairs — metal folding, plastic folding</li>
        <li>Coolers, projector & screen, trash/recycling pop-ups</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="content-split__buttons">
        <a href="/resources/event-equipment/" class="theme_btn theme_btn_bg">View Equipment <span></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
